      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i didn't know about the reye's thing thanks. i do have some tylenol though but i only have the adult strength 500mg tablets in the cabinet right now. i dont have any of the kids liquid stuff. would it be okay to just crush up one of those adult ones and give it to him? i can just guess the amount based on his weight so it's not too much.",
